// Verificator options (LS-DCU-GDE-001 section 8). Used as
//   Verificator.exe dcu_fsm.vsp <System> --@options/verificator.opt
// by firmware/dcu/scripts/vs/Invoke-VsVerify.ps1 for WinCtrl, DoorCtrl and ModeMgr.
// Pass criteria: zero critical findings (conflicting transitions, ambiguous assignments,
// signal queue size); no dead ends except the terminal state Safe of ModeMgr; no unused
// events, variables, constants or actions. Option spellings are confirmed against the option
// list printed by Verificator.exe (Lab Host check D9).

// Full verification: critical and non-critical checks
-full
